# clangd for the core: each file's real flags from the release build folder, and the background index kept to the core's own
# sources. The libraries the build fetches or carries (godot-cpp with its generated bindings, mimalloc, meshoptimizer, Clipper2)
# are over a thousand translation units: indexed in the background they took the language server to 9 GB of memory in use
# (24 GB committed) in one session. They are still parsed when a core file includes them; only their own index is skipped.
CompileFlags:
  CompilationDatabase: build-win
---
If:
  PathMatch: [godot-cpp/.*, build[^/]*/.*]
Index:
  Background: Skip
